  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><h2 data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"168\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"166\">About Our Brand and Products</strong></h2><p data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"546\">Troll Clothes is a bold, streetwear-inspired clothing brand built around humor, wit, and originality. We create <strong data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"319\">funny, sarcastic, and edgy apparel</strong> that speaks to people who love to stand out and express themselves unapologetically. Our catalog includes custom graphic tees, hoodies, hats, and accessories with troll-inspired designs that are equal parts playful and bold.</p><h2 data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"580\"><strong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"578\">What Makes Us Different</strong></h2><p data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"915\">We aren’t just another clothing label — Troll Clothes is an attitude. Our designs mix <strong data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"722\">dark humor, meme culture, and streetwear aesthetics</strong> to create pieces that spark conversation. Every product is made-to-order to reduce waste and keep our collections exclusive, so our customers are always wearing something fresh and original.</p><h2 data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"949\"><strong data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"947\">How Affiliates Can Earn</strong></h2><ul data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1239\"><li data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1028\"><p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1028\"><strong data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"981\">Generous Commission Rates</strong> – Earn a percentage on every sale you refer.</p></li><li data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1127\"><p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1127\"><strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1059\">High Conversion Products</strong> – Our funny and edgy designs naturally attract clicks and shares.</p></li><li data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1239\"><p data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1239\"><strong data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1150\">Repeat Customers</strong> – Because of our limited drops and trending collections, customers come back for more.</p></li></ul><h2 data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1267\"><strong data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1265\">How to Promote Us</strong></h2><ul data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1648\"><li data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1372\"><p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1372\">Share your unique affiliate link on <strong data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1332\">social media platforms</strong> like TikTok, Instagram, and Facebook.</p></li><li data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1469\"><p data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1469\">Create <strong data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1403\">UGC-style content</strong> featuring our products (funny videos, styling tips, unboxings).</p></li><li data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1552\"><p data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1552\">Use our designs in <strong data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1519\">memes, reels, or stories</strong> to drive curiosity and clicks.</p></li><li data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1648\"><p data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1648\">Add our products to your <strong data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1620\">blogs, fashion sites, or newsletters</strong> with your affiliate link.</p></li></ul></div>",
